# Repo safety

- Do not delete `fase-*` trees, `templates/`, `FASE_*.md`, or Docsify root files unless the user explicitly asks
- Do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks
- Prefer additive edits; ask before large renames that break phase checklist links
- Keep GitHub Pages entrypoints intact: `index.html`, `_sidebar.md`, `.nojekyll`
